{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-7-1","title":"Revelation 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An angel seals the servants of God in their foreheads. 4 The number of them that were sealed: of the tribes of Israel a certain number. 9 Of all the other nations an innumerable multitude, which stand before the throne, clad in white robes, and palms in their hands. 14 Their robes were washed in the blood of the Lamb.</p>\n<p>after. 4:1-6:17 four angels. 4:6; 9:14; Eze 7:2; 37:9; Zec 1:18-20; 6:1; Mt 24:31; Mr 13:27 holding. Isa 27:8; Jer 49:36; Da 7:2; 8:8; Jon 1:4; Mt 8:26,27; 24:31 the wind. 6:6; 9:4; Isa 27:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-2","title":"Revelation 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>And I. 8:3; 10:1; Mal 3:1; 4:2; Ac 7:30-32 having. 3-8; 5:2; 10:4; So 8:6; Joh 6:27; 2Co 1:22; Eph 1:13; 4:30; 2Ti 2:19 living. De 5:26; 1Sa 17:26,36; 2Ki 19:4; Mt 26:63; 1Th 1:9; Heb 12:22 to whom. 1:3; 8:7-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-3","title":"Revelation 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Hurt not. 6:6; 9:4; Isa 6:13; 27:8; 65:8; Mt 24:22,31 till. 14:1; Ex 12:13,23; Isa 26:20,21; Ex 9:4-6; Zep 2:3 the servants. 19:2; Isa 54:17; Da 3:17,26; 6:16; Mal 3:18; Joh 12:26; Ro 6:22 in their. 13:16; 14:1; 20:4; 22:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-4","title":"Revelation 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I heard. 9:16 an. 14:1,3; Ge 15:5; Ro 9:27; 11:5,6 all. Eze 47:13; 48:19,31; Zec 9:1; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30; Ac 26:7; Jas 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-5","title":"Revelation 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>tribe of Juda. Ex 1:2-4; Nu 1:4-15; 10:14-27; 13:4-16; 1Co 2:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-6","title":"Revelation 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Aser. Lu 2:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-7","title":"Revelation 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Simeon. Nu 1:22; 25:14; 26:14; Jos 19:1; Jud 1:3 Levi. Ge 29:34; 35:23; 49:5; Ex 6:16 Issachar. Ge 30:18; 35:23; 49:11; Jos 19:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-9","title":"Revelation 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a great. Ge 49:10; Ps 2:8; 22:27; 72:7-11; 76:4; 77:2; 98:3; 110:2,3; 117:1,2 Isa 2:2,3; 49:6-8; 60:1-14; Jer 3:17; 16:19; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23 Ro 15:9-12 no man. 5:11; 11:15; Ge 13:16; Ho 1:10; Lu 12:1; Ro 11:25; Heb 11:12; 12:22 of all. 5:9; Da 4:1; 6:25 stood. Lu 21:36; Eph 6:13 clothed. 13,14; 3:4,5,18; 4:4; 6:11 palms. Le 23:40; Joh 12:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-10","title":"Revelation 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>cried. Zec 4:7 Salvation. 19:1; Ps 3:8; 37:39; 68:19,20; 115:1; Isa 43:11; 45:15,21; Jer 3:23 Ho 13:4; Jon 2:9; Zec 9:9; Lu 3:6; Joh 4:22; Eph 2:8 sitteth. 4:2,3,9-11; 5:7,13,14; 21:5 unto. 4:6,9; 22:3; Joh 1:29,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-11","title":"Revelation 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>all. 4:6; 5:11-13; 19:4-6; Ps 103:20,21; 148:1,2 and fell. 11:16 and worshipped. 4:10; 15:4; 19:4; 22:9; Ps 45:11; 97:7; Mt 4:10; Joh 5:23; Heb 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-12","title":"Revelation 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Amen. 1:18; 5:13,14; 19:4; Ps 41:13; 72:19; 89:52; 106:48; Mt 6:13; Jude 1:25 Blessing. 5:12,13 thanksgiving. Ne 12:8,46; Ps 50:14; 95:2; 100:4; 107:22; 116:17; 147:7; Isa 51:3 Jer 33:9,11; Jon 2:9; 2Co 4:15; 9:11,12; Col 2:7; 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-13","title":"Revelation 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>one. 4:4,10; 5:5,11 arrayed. 9 whence. Ge 16:8; Jud 13:6; Joh 7:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-14","title":"Revelation 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>thou. Ex 37:3 came. 2:9; 6:9-11; 15:2; 17:6; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22; Ro 5:3; 2Th 1:4 and have. 1:5; Isa 1:18; Zec 3:3-5; 13:1; Joh 13:8-14; 1Co 6:11; Eph 5:26,27 Heb 9:14; 1Jo 1:7 the blood. 5:9; 12:11; Heb 13:12; 1Pe 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-15","title":"Revelation 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>are. 4:4; 14:3-5; Heb 8:1; 12:2 serve. 20:10; 22:5; Ps 134:1,2 dwell. 21:3,4; 22:3; Ex 29:45; 1Ki 6:13; 1Ch 23:25; Ps 68:16-18; Isa 4:5,6 Joh 1:14; 1Co 3:16; 2Co 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-16","title":"Revelation 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>hunger. Ps 42:2; 63:1; 143:6; Isa 41:17; 49:10; 65:13; Mt 5:6; Lu 1:53; 6:21 Joh 4:14 the sun. 21:4; Ps 121:6; So 1:6; Isa 4:5,6; 25:4; 32:2; Jon 4:8; Mt 13:6,21 Mr 4:6,17; Jas 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-7-17","title":"Revelation 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>in the. 5:6 feed. Ps 22:26; 23:1,2,5; 28:9; 36:8; So 1:7,8; Isa 25:6; 40:11; 49:9 Eze 34:23; Mic 5:4; 7:14; Mt 2:6; *marg: Joh 10:11,14; 21:15-17; Ac 20:28; 1Pe 5:2 shall lead. 21:6; Ps 36:9; Isa 12:3; 30:25; 35:6,7; Jer 2:13; 31:9; Joh 4:11,14 Joh 7:37,38 God. 4:11; 21:4; Isa 25:8; 30:19; 35:10; 60:20</p>"}]}